      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "実はサラミス迎賓館にも、正直に連絡したんだ。\nそしたら、事情を汲んで待ってくれるってさ。\n噂なんかを信じるもんじゃないね……\n信じられるのは、ぼうやみたいな良い子だけだよ。",
        "official_en": "I told the Saramis folks what was going on, and they\nsaid they understand and would wait. After all the\nstories I heard about them, it was quite a surprise!\nI shouldn't trust rumors... Just good kids like you!",
